## Interface: 16001
## Title: Laurels
## Notes: Custom RP achievements, titles, and rival challenges.
## Author: charl
## Version: 0.2.0
## SavedVariables: LaurelsDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: LaurelsCharDB
## OptionalDeps: totalRP3

# Measured: this client refuses SAY/YELL and carries a custom CHANNEL, so the
# ladder here is server-wide rather than proximity-based. /deed channel
# overrides it; the transport also falls back on its own if this is wrong.
## X-BroadcastChannel: CHANNEL

# Measured at launch (1.60.1, build 70790): registering
# COMBAT_LOG_EVENT_UNFILTERED is forbidden here, as on modern retail. Kills,
# melee swings and deaths use PARTY_KILL, PLAYER_SWING and the death recap
# instead.
## X-CombatLog: closed

# NOTE: ## Interface above is the client's TOC version, NOT its build number.
# WoW-Forever 1.60.1 (build 70532, Oct 20 2026) reports TOC version 16001.
# To re-check after a client patch, run in-game:
#   /run print(GetBuildInfo())
# which prints version, build, date, tocversion -- use the LAST value here.
# If the addon still shows as out of date, tick "Load out of date AddOns" on
# the character-select AddOns screen.

